    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25406" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διανομ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distribution,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				535a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1329b41
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαιὰς δ. καταφθίσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					727
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισθῶν διανομαί</span>”
