					Plu.
					<u>Per.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; esp. of <i>doles</i> or <i>largess,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(5).663.22
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Syros</span>), <i><span class="en">
				951.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Tenos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				1.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pisc.</u>
				41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				1.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>division</i> or <i>factorization</i> of numbers, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				747a
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				771c
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>regulation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ δ. τῶν πραγμάτων ἕπεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.102e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τοῦ νοῦ δ. ἐπονομάζοντας νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					714a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
